PE 813: XOR-Powers / 异或幂

=== Problem Summary ===
XOR-product: long multiplication in base 2, XOR instead of add.
x ⊗ y = polynomial multiplication in GF(2)[x].
11 = 1011₂ = x^3 + x + 1
P(n) = 11^{⊗n} = (x^3 + x + 1)^n in GF(2)[x]

=== Verify P(2) = 69 ===
  P(2) = 69 (expected 69) ✓

  P(2) [fast] = 69

=== Small P(n) values ===
  P(1) = 11
  P(2) = 69
  P(3) = 743
  P(4) = 4113
  P(5) = 45243

=== PE Answer ===
  N = 8^12 * 12^8 = 2^52 * 3^8
  P(8^12 * 12^8) mod 10^9+7 = 14063639
